    "updated_at": "2019-10-03T19:50:40Z",
    "body": "As I suggested on https://github.com/WICG/intrinsicsize-attribute/issues/16#issuecomment-537846707, I think we can update the [update the image data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#update-the-image-data) algorithm to pick the aspect ratio from the selected source.\r\n\r\nFor consistency, it seems like it would be better to add `width` and `height` attributes.",
